{"title":"降低实体经济企业成本！","date":"2024-05-28","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">降低实体经济企业成本！</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<strong><i><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nArial;color:white;letter-spacing:.4pt;background:#007AAA\">要点速览<span lang=\"EN-US\">&mdash;&mdash;</span></span></i></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">●<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"color:black\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 15pt; color: black;\">国家发展改革委等四部门发布《关于做好<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年降成本重点工作的通知》，明确<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span></strong><strong>年降低实体经济企业成本</strong>将重点落实好<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>个方面<span lang=\"EN-US\">22</span>项任务。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">● </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">适当<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">降低</strong>先进技术装备和资源品进口关税。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">● </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">畅通货币政策传导机制，避免资金沉淀空转。<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">推动贷款利率稳中有降。</strong></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">●&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 15pt; letter-spacing: 0.4pt;\">强化落实《保障中小企业款项支付条例》，推动机关、事业单位、大型企业<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">及时支付</strong></span>中小企业货物、工程、服务款项。</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">●&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black\">延续实施</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black\">阶段性降低失业保险、工伤保险费率政策，实施期限延长至<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span></strong><strong>年底</strong>。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">● </span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\ncolor:black\">持续推进工业用地由出让为主向<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">出让、租赁并重</strong>转变。健全长期租赁、先租后让、弹性年期出让等多元化供应体系。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">●&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">强化对<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">制造业企业技术改造</strong></span>的资金支持，<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">落实技术改造投资相关税收优惠政策</strong>，推进传统产业高端化、智能化、绿色化转型。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">国家发展改革委办公厅等关于做好<span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">2024</span>年降成本重点工作的通知</span></span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">发改办运行〔<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>〕<span lang=\"EN-US\">428</span>号</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: center; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; visibility: visible; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">公安部、民政部、司法部、人力资源社会保障部、自然资源部、生态环境部、住房城乡建设部、交通运输部、水利部、农业农村部、商务部、国务院国资委、海关总署、税务总局、市场监管总局、金融监管总局、中国证监会、国家统计局、国家知识产权局、国家能源局、国家林草局、中国民航局、国家外汇局办公厅（办公室），中国国家铁路集团有限公司，各省、自治区、直辖市及计划单列市、副省级省会城市、新疆生产建设兵团发展改革委、工业和信息化主管部门、财政厅（局），人民银行上海总部，各省、自治区、直辖市及计划单列市分行：</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">近年来，各地区、各有关部门按照党中央、国务院决策部署，多措并举激发各类经营主体活力，推动降低实体经济企业成本工作取得显著成效。为深入贯彻中央经济工作会议精神，落实好《政府工作报告》提出的各项降成本重点任务，全力支持实体经济高质量发展，<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年降低实体经济企业成本工作部际联席会议将重点组织落实好<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>个方面<span lang=\"EN-US\">22</span>项任务。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">一、提高税费优惠政策的针对性有效性</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（一）优化税费优惠政策。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">落实好研发费用税前加计扣除、科技成果转化税收减免等结构性减税降费政策，重点支持科技创新和制造业发展，强化企业科技创新主体地位。适当降低先进技术装备和资源品进口关税。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（二）强化涉企收费监管。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">坚决查处乱收费、乱罚款、乱摊派。聚焦政府部门及下属单位、行业协会、金融机构、天然气管网和供水企业等领域，依法查处行政审批中介服务违规收费、行业协会依托行政权力违规收费、金融机构不落实收费减免政策、天然气管网和供水企业不执行政府定价等行为。研究建立常态化涉企收费协同监管体系和工作机制，落实涉企收费目录清单制度，完善涉企收费联合监管、联合惩戒机制，提升涉企收费监管的法治化水平。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">二、提升金融服务实体经济质效</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（三）营造良好的货币金融环境。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">稳健的货币政策要灵活适度、精准有效，综合运用多种货币政策工具，保持流动性合理充裕，社会融资规模、货币供应量同经济增长和价格水平预期目标相匹配。畅通货币政策传导机制，避免资金沉淀空转。保持人民币汇率在合理均衡水平上的基本稳定。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（四）推动贷款利率稳中有降。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">持续发挥贷款市场报价利率（<span lang=\"EN-US\">LPR</span>）改革效能和存款利率市场化调整机制的重要作用，在保持商业银行净息差基本稳定的基础上，促进社会综合融资成本稳中有降。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（五）引导金融资源精准滴灌。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">保持再贷款、再贴现政策稳定性，实施好普惠小微贷款支持工具，继续对涉农、小微企业、民营企业提供普惠性、持续性的资金支持。发挥存款准备金政策的正向激励作用，继续对农村金融机构执行差别化存款准备金率政策。深入开展中小微企业金融服务能力提升工程，继续开展小微、民营企业信贷政策导向效果评估。优化商业银行小微企业金融服务监管评价制度，完善小微授信尽职免责制度，加大普惠型小微企业贷款投放。引导金融机构持续加大对乡村振兴、科技创新、制造业、绿色发展等重大战略、重点领域和薄弱环节的金融支持力度。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（六）持续优化金融服务。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">健全全国一体化融资信用服务平台网络，扩大涉企信用信息共享范围。优化征信市场布局，推动征信机构增加征信有效供给，推动信用评级机构提升评级质量和服务水平。优化动产融资统一登记公示系统和应收账款融资服务平台功能。持续推进知识产权质押融资。推进政府采购合同融资。发挥国家产融合作平台作用，强化金融服务供给，精准对接企业融资需求。实施科技创新专项担保计划，加大国家融资担保基金对科技型中小企业风险分担和补偿力度。实施&ldquo;科技产业金融一体化&rdquo;专项，加强科技型企业全生命周期金融服务，引导早期投资和创业投资支持独角兽企业培育发展。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（七）降低中小微企业汇率避险成本。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">推动银行建立健全服务企业汇率风险管理长效机制，丰富汇率避险产品，加强宣传培训，优化中小微企业授信和保证金管理制度，加强政银担多方协作，共同降低中小微企业外汇套保成本。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">三、持续降低制度性交易成本</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（八）营造公平竞争市场环境。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">制定关于完善市场准入制度的意见，修订新版市场准入负面清单，推动市场准入效能评估全覆盖。持续深入开展民生领域反垄断执法专项行动，加强重点领域反垄断监管执法。开展涉及不平等对待企业的行政法规、规章、规范性文件和政策性文件清理工作，降低企业制度性交易成本。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（九）加强知识产权保护。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">加大知识产权行政保护力度。提升知识产权公共服务效能，加快建设国家知识产权保护信息平台，强化知识产权数据开放共享，新建一批国家重点产业专利专题数据库，持续优化知识产权信息公共服务产品和工具。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十）规范招投标和政府采购制度。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">积极推进招标投标法及其实施条例、政府采购法修改工作。出台招标投标领域公平竞争审查规则，从源头上减少排斥、限制公平竞争的规定和做法。完善招标投标全流程电子化交易技术标准和数据规范，积极推动数字证书（<span lang=\"EN-US\">CA</span>）全国互认，降低企业交易成本。开展政府采购领域&ldquo;四类&rdquo;违法违规行为专项整治，加强常态化行政执法检查，创新手段提升监管效能。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十一）健全防范化解拖欠企业账款长效机制。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">强化落实《保障中小企业款项支付条例》，推动机关、事业单位、大型企业及时支付中小企业货物、工程、服务款项。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十二）优化外商投资环境。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">继续缩减外资准入负面清单，全面取消制造业领域外资准入限制措施，放宽有关服务业市场准入。扩大鼓励外商投资产业目录。加强外商投资服务保障。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">四、缓解企业人工成本压力</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十三）继续阶段性降低部分社会保险费率。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">延续实施阶段性降低失业保险、工伤保险费率政策，实施期限延长至<span lang=\"EN-US\">2025</span>年底。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十四）支持企业稳岗扩岗。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">落实和完善稳岗返还、专项贷款、就业和社保补贴等政策，加强对就业容量大的行业企业支持。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十五）加强公共实训基地共建共享。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">推动公共实训基地建设扩容提质，针对重点群体加大培训服务力度，强化技能人才培养和企业用工保障。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">五、降低企业用地原材料成本</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十六）降低企业用地成本。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">持续推进工业用地由出让为主向出让、租赁并重转变。健全长期租赁、先租后让、弹性年期出让等多元化供应体系。研究地下空间开发利用政策，实行向下递减的地价优惠政策，降低企业初期用地成本。指导地方因地制宜适时调整更新基准地价，进一步提升土地要素的支撑保障能力。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十七）加强能源资源保障。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">推进实施新一轮找矿突破战略行动，加强重要能源、矿产资源国内勘探开发和增储上产，大力推动支撑性电源建设投产，提高能源资源安全保障能力。落实好《矿业权出让收益征收办法》，推动矿产相关行业健康有序发展。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">六、推进物流提质增效降本</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十八）实施降低物流成本行动。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">研究制定《有效降低全社会物流成本行动方案》，强化政策协同和工作合力，有力推动降低全社会物流成本，增强企业和实体经济竞争力。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（十九）完善现代物流体系。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">稳步推进国家物流枢纽、国家骨干冷链物流基地建设，促进现代物流高质量发展。新增支持一批城市开展国家综合货运枢纽补链强链，推动跨运输方式一体化融合。继续实施县域商业建设行动，支持建设改造县级物流配送中心和乡镇快递物流站点，完善仓储、运输、配送等设施，加快补齐农村商业设施短板，健全县乡村物流配送体系。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（二十）调整优化运输结构。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">大力发展多式联运，支持引导多式联运&ldquo;一单制&rdquo;&ldquo;一箱制&rdquo;发展。加快推进港口、物流园区等铁路专用线建设，大力推动大宗货物和中长距离货物运输&ldquo;公转水&rdquo;&ldquo;公转铁&rdquo;，提高运输组织效率，促进港口集装箱铁水联运量保持较快增长，推动港口、物流园区、工矿企业大宗货物绿色集疏运比例稳步提升。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">七、激励企业内部挖潜</span></strong></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（二十一）支持企业转型升级降本。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">强化对制造业企业技术改造的资金支持，落实技术改造投资相关税收优惠政策，推进传统产业高端化、智能化、绿色化转型。研究制定促进专精特新中小企业高质量发展的政策措施，加大对重点产业链中小企业支持力度。积极推进中小企业数字化转型。优化完善首台（套）重大技术装备保险补偿政策，聚焦国家战略领域，促进首台（套）重大技术装备推广应用和迭代创新。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.65pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">（二十二）引导企业提高生产经营效率。</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:\r\n15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">深入实施智能制造工程，支持企业建设智能工厂和智慧供应链，构建基于场景的企业标准群。实施制造业数字化转型行动，鼓励企业开展数字化转型贯标、工业互联网平台贯标，以两化深度融合推动企业提升生产、经营等环节数字化水平，提升生产和管理效率，降低运营成本。</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:\r\n华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">各有关方面要进一步完善降成本工作协调推进机制，强化协同联动，密切跟踪重点任务进展情况，扎实推进各项政策落地见效。加强降成本政策宣传，让企业了解并用好各项优惠政策。深入开展企业成本调查研究，认真听取和吸纳企业意见建议，积极回应企业关切，不断完善相关政策。降低实体经济企业成本工作部际联席会议将继续加强对好经验、好做法的梳理，并做好宣传和推广。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: justify; text-indent: 31.6pt; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"margin: 0cm; text-align: right; line-height: 21pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;letter-spacing:.4pt\">国家发展改革委办公厅<br style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\" />\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">工业和信息化部办公厅<br style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\" />\r\n\t财政部办公厅<br style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\" />\r\n\t人民银行办公厅<br style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\" />\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">13</span>日</span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;letter-spacing:.4pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}